---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';
const phone = '+13615550199';
const phoneDisplay = '(361) 555-0199';
---
<Layout title="General Pest Control Victoria TX | Year-Round Protection" description="Ongoing general pest control in Victoria, TX. Protect your home from ants, roaches, spiders and more with our local service plans.">
  <section class="page-hero">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="breadcrumb"><a href="/">Home</a> → <a href="/#services">Services</a> → General Pest Control</div>
      <h1>General Pest Control in Victoria, TX</h1>
      <p>Consistent protection against the pests that invade South Texas homes year-round.</p>
      <a href={`tel:${phone}`} class="btn btn-primary">Get a Quote — {phoneDisplay}</a>
    </div>
  </section>
  <section class="section">
    <div class="container content-block">
      <h2>Why General Pest Control Matters</h2>
      <p>Victoria’s climate supports a steady parade of ants, cockroaches, spiders, silverfish and other household pests. A one-time treatment helps, but a regular service plan keeps populations from bouncing back after rain, heat waves or seasonal changes.</p>
      <h2>What’s Included</h2>
      <ul>
        <li>Interior and exterior treatment of key entry points and harborage areas</li>
        <li>Focus on ants, roaches, spiders, crickets and similar crawling pests</li>
        <li>Inspection of common problem zones (kitchen, bathrooms, foundation, garage)</li>
        <li>Recommendations for exclusion and sanitation that improve results</li>
        <li>Flexible monthly or quarterly schedules</li>
      </ul>
      <h2>How Often Should You Treat?</h2>
      <p>Most Victoria homes do well on a quarterly plan. Properties with heavy pressure, pets, or nearby open fields may benefit from monthly service. We’ll recommend the right frequency after the initial inspection.</p>
      <p style="margin-top:2rem;text-align:center"><a href={`tel:${phone}`} class="btn btn-primary">Schedule General Pest Control</a></p>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>
